{
  "title": { "zh": "装成一台扫描器", "en": "Assemble the scanner" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-8\"></level-ref>的 Sobel 在细纹上更稳定，但直接扫描仍会把纸面斑点误报为纸边。扩大平滑尺度能减少误报，也可能擦掉窄笔画。用两张校准图找一个尺度，让同一台扫描器能处理这两种情况。",
        "en": "Sobel is more stable on fine patterns, but a raw scan can still mistake paper specks for edges. A broader scale reduces false marks and can erase a narrow stroke. Use two calibration scans to find a scale that works for both. <level-ref to=\"1-8\"></level-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[\\begin{gathered}M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\\\B=\\begin{cases}1,&M>\\tau\\\\0,&M\\le\\tau\\end{cases}\\end{gathered}\\]\n\ngx、gy 是经过灰度图平滑后测得的方向分量，τ 是给定响应阈值。M 保留强弱，B 只保留是否严格超标。处理顺序和边界影响测量结果；强响应标记也不等于完整物体轮廓。 <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[\\begin{gathered}M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\\\B=\\begin{cases}1,&M>\\tau\\\\0,&M\\le\\tau\\end{cases}\\end{gathered}\\]\n\ngx and gy are directional measurements after smoothing the grayscale input; τ is the supplied threshold. M retains response size while B retains only strict exceedance. Order and border rules affect the measurement; strong-response marks are not complete object contours. <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v1_scanner",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "装配扫描器",
        "en": "Assemble scanner"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "用同一台扫描器处理带斑点的纸边和窄笔画。选择高斯尺度，使目标边缘得到标记、干扰不被标记。输出响应和严格超过阈值的标记，比较图样来决定尺度与接法。",
        "en": "Use one scanner for a speckled paper edge and a narrow stroke. Choose a Gaussian scale that marks the target edges while leaving interference unmarked. Return the response and marks strictly above the threshold. Use the cases to decide scale and wiring."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "灰度扫描图", "en": "Grayscale scan" } },
        { "name": "threshold", "label": { "zh": "响应阈值", "en": "Response threshold" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "strength", "label": { "zh": "扫描响应", "en": "Scanner response" } },
